      "review_summary": "The PR adds a fixed 30-second timer to reject and close a ChatGPT Responses WebSocket that has not completed its opening handshake.\n\nPR surface: Source +28. Total +28 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: no. live reproduction was established. Source inspection shows that current main awaits the WebSocket transport before the auto-mode fallback can proceed, so a non-settling opening promise is source-reproducible in principle.",
